38
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:10,690
Hello, Teacher Ria.

39
00:04:10,690 --> 00:04:18,750
Thank you so much for always making great videos.

40
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:22,930
My name is Marina.

41
00:04:22,930 --> 00:04:28,150
I am 25 years old.

42
00:04:28,150 --> 00:04:31,260
I am 25 years old.

43
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:39,650
Actually, I didn’t know much about Korea before.

44
00:04:39,650 --> 00:04:52,560
But I met a Korean man in Germany and fell in love.

45
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:58,670
We got married two years ago.

46
00:04:58,670 --> 00:05:14,820
After getting married, we traveled the world and lived for a long time in Canada, Germany, Malaysia, and Vietnam.

47
00:05:14,820 --> 00:05:28,480
In the past two years, I made many Korean friends, but language was always a problem.

48
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,050
Language.

49
00:05:30,050 --> 00:05:38,420
My friends couldn’t speak English, and I couldn’t speak Korean.

50
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:52,030
And when my husband talked with his family or friends, I couldn’t join the conversation, so I felt a bit sad.

51
00:05:52,030 --> 00:05:56,660
I felt a bit sad because I couldn’t join the conversation.

52
00:05:56,660 --> 00:06:03,150
I also felt sorry that everyone spoke English because of me.

53
00:06:03,150 --> 00:06:12,790
Recently, we are thinking about moving to Jeju Island and living there.

54
00:06:12,790 --> 00:06:27,570
So to talk with people around the house and have fun in the new home, I really need to learn Korean quickly.

55
00:06:27,570 --> 00:06:33,790
I have many friends all over Korea.

56
00:06:33,790 --> 00:06:45,930
I’m really excited to finally be able to properly talk with those friends again.

57
00:06:45,930 --> 00:06:47,610
I’m looking forward to it!

58
00:06:47,610 --> 00:06:53,290
This is my Korean study story.

59
00:06:53,290 --> 00:07:00,000
I’m really happy to have found Teacher Ria’s channel.

60
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,490
Thank you.

61
00:07:01,490 --> 00:07:05,660
Thank you so much, Marina!

62
00:07:05,660 --> 00:07:10,200
