64
00:07:13,410 --> 00:07:19,740
It’s amazing that you met a Korean person in Germany.

65
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:24,290
And you even got married.

66
00:07:24,290 --> 00:07:29,770
You traveled the world together... That’s cool!

67
00:07:29,770 --> 00:07:35,280
This is the kind of love I want.

68
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:42,330
Meeting overseas and having a love like a drama?

69
00:07:42,330 --> 00:07:51,100
As a Korean, I really like this kind of dramatic love.

70
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:52,920
I want that!

71
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:59,150
As a Korean, I have K-drama inside me.

72
00:07:59,150 --> 00:08:09,960
Anyway! Love is a really big motivation to learn a language.

73
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:18,740
It’s also the fastest way to learn a language.

74
00:08:18,740 --> 00:08:29,820
Simply talking a lot in that language with your partner is one way...

75
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:40,340
But you know that feeling where you want to get closer to that person and get more passionate?

76
00:08:40,340 --> 00:08:52,450
So even when you’re not talking with that person, you study passionately on your own behind the scenes.

77
00:08:52,450 --> 00:08:54,060
That passion.

78
00:08:54,060 --> 00:08:59,320
I think that is love.

79
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:08,500
Anyway, Marina, I hope you have a great time in Jeju.

80
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:14,100
Make lots of fun memories there.

81
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:24,040
I also like Jeju, so I want to travel there for a long time someday.

82
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:26,110
Living for a month.

83
00:09:26,110 --> 00:09:31,770
I will definitely do something like living there for a month.

84
00:09:31,770 --> 00:09:39,530
Marina has many reasons to study Korean.

85
00:09:39,530 --> 00:09:42,760
She has a lot of motivation.

86
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:48,510
Then you naturally end up studying.

87
00:09:48,510 --> 00:09:50,180
Naturally!

88
00:09:50,180 --> 00:09:54,180
So don’t worry.

89
00:09:54,180 --> 00:09:56,630
Don’t worry.

90
00:09:56,630 --> 00:10:01,860
Enjoy and study happily.

91
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:11,540
Try saying the sentences you studied today to your husband or friends.

92
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:15,970
Practice like that every day.

93
00:10:15,970 --> 00:10:18,530
Okay? Fighting!!

94
00:10:18,530 --> 00:10:22,850
I’ll always support your Korean studies.

