101
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:11,950
Your pronunciation is really accurate and your expressions are rich, so I subscribed.

102
00:11:11,950 --> 00:11:17,800
It’s really good for listening practice.

103
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:28,190
