150
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:23,440
I like cooking, so I’ve cooked a lot,

151
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:30,910
but my foreign friends have never cooked Korean food for me.

152
00:17:30,910 --> 00:17:32,830
How about you?

153
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:39,960
If you have any Korean dishes you can make, please let me know!

154
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:44,490
