230
00:27:50,420 --> 00:27:58,500
Wanting to research Korean history is really amazing.

231
00:27:58,500 --> 00:28:04,060
As a Korean, I am very grateful.

232
00:28:04,060 --> 00:28:18,340
Actually, when I was in school, my favorite subjects were English and history.

233
00:28:18,340 --> 00:28:26,530
In Korean high schools, students take the CSAT before graduation.

234
00:28:26,530 --> 00:28:28,370
CSAT

235
00:28:28,370 --> 00:28:32,590
CSAT is the name of the exam.

236
00:28:32,590 --> 00:28:34,880
Exam name

237
00:28:34,880 --> 00:28:41,300
It is an important exam like the SAT.

238
