It is a necessary exam for entering university.

239
00:28:46,180 --> 00:28:56,050
You must take exams in Korean, English, Math, and Korean History.

240
00:28:56,050 --> 00:29:05,700
All students take exams in Korean, English, Math, and Korean History.

241
00:29:05,700 --> 00:29:07,710
Four subjects.

242
00:29:07,710 --> 00:29:09,260
Four subjects.

243
00:29:09,260 --> 00:29:18,290
These are mandatory, and then you have to choose two more subjects.

244
00:29:18,290 --> 00:29:20,190
You have to choose more.

245
00:29:20,190 --> 00:29:24,240
There are many subjects.

246
00:29:24,240 --> 00:29:33,380
You have to choose subjects you are good at or like.

247
00:29:33,380 --> 00:29:40,860
I chose East Asian History and World History.

