00:29:40,860 --> 00:29:49,930
Studying these two together was interesting because similar content appeared.

249
00:29:49,930 --> 00:29:54,480
It was fascinating and fun.

250
00:29:54,480 --> 00:30:02,880
I was really into history in high school.

251
00:30:02,880 --> 00:30:12,380
Especially in World History, I was always first place. First place!

252
00:30:12,380 --> 00:30:14,400
Really.

253
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:19,360
