254
00:30:19,360 --> 00:30:27,170
I was really good at subjects I liked.

255
00:30:27,170 --> 00:30:33,290
But I was really bad at science and stuff.

256
00:30:33,290 --> 00:30:46,660
Actually, that's why I want to share Korean history stories with you on this podcast.

257
00:30:46,660 --> 00:30:52,190
Really interesting Korean history stories.

258
00:30:52,190 --> 00:31:01,960
But many people think history is boring, right?

259
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:09,990
Many people think it's boring and difficult.

260
00:31:09,990 --> 00:31:17,180
So I am waiting for the right timing.

261
00:31:17,180 --> 00:31:22,880
I am waiting until the channel grows bigger.

262
00:31:22,880 --> 00:31:28,740
So please subscribe!

263
00:31:28,740 --> 00:31:33,600
Please leave lots of comments!

264
00:31:33,600 --> 00:31:37,850
That is the biggest support.

265
00:31:37,850 --> 00:31:42,550
It is the biggest support for me.

266
00:31:42,550 --> 00:31:50,320
Anyway, Landon, we have a lot in common.

267
00:31:50,320 --> 00:32:02,300
Oh, and my favorite Korean movie is also Parasite.

268
00:32:02,300 --> 00:32:10,430
