271
00:32:34,010 --> 00:32:43,100
It seems like a movie that has a charm that draws people in, right?

272
00:32:43,100 --> 00:32:49,410
But my channel has many young students.

273
00:32:49,410 --> 00:32:53,180
Young students! You shouldn't watch this movie.

274
00:32:53,180 --> 00:32:55,300
Not yet.

275
00:32:55,300 --> 00:32:57,540
It's a bit scary.

276
00:32:57,540 --> 00:33:04,480
Anyway, I sincerely support Landon's dream!

277
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:17,760
You said you are a beginner in Korean, but I was surprised at how well you speak Korean.

278
00:33:17,760 --> 00:33:20,200
