325
00:40:11,580 --> 00:40:23,230
Honestly, I didn't expect the movie K-POP Demon Hunters, Kedehun! to become this popular.

326
00:40:23,230 --> 00:40:34,280
But thanks to that movie, many people wanted to learn Korean.

327
00:40:34,280 --> 00:40:48,670
And Terence said that he wasn't interested in Korean before, but now he is interested and studying it.

328
00:40:48,670 --> 00:40:49,480
That's right.

329
00:40:49,480 --> 00:41:03,680
Korean wasn't this popular in the past, but more and more people are studying it now.

330
00:41:03,680 --> 00:41:11,950
So I hope Korean becomes even more famous.

331
00:41:11,950 --> 00:41:17,440
Korean is truly a beautiful language!

332
00:41:17,440 --> 00:41:25,480
And you are already studying Korean right now.

333
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:33,150
If you study now, how much better will you be later?

334
00:41:33,150 --> 00:41:47,360
