337
00:42:02,620 --> 00:42:11,680
Mom, today I learned how to say "I love you" in Korean.

338
00:42:11,680 --> 00:42:14,600
"Saranghae!" like this (.... haha)

339
00:42:14,600 --> 00:42:29,660
I hope you teach Korean to people around you, and that your friends also become interested in Korean.

340
00:42:29,660 --> 00:42:44,960
Anyway... Terence! Korean is very difficult, but I hope you study it with patience and fun.

341
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:52,440
You know I always support you, right? Fighting!

